=== cargo-generate-rpm ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Generate a binary RPM package (.rpm) from Cargo projects


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  cargo-generate-rpm [OPTIONS]


FLAGS (14) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-a, --arch <ARCH>              Target arch of generated package
-o, --output <OUTPUT>          Output file or directory
-p, --package <PACKAGE>        Name of a crate in the workspace for which
                               RPM package will be generated
    --auto-req <AUTO_REQ>      Automatic dependency processing mode.
                               [default: auto]
                                 values:
                                   auto                    Use the preferred
                                                           automatic
                                                           dependency
                                                           process.
                                   disabled                Disable the
                                                           discovery of
                                                           dependencies.
                                                           [alias: no]
                                   builtin                 Use the builtin
                                                           procedure based
                                                           on ldd.
                                   find-requires           Use
                                                           /usr/lib/rpm/find
                                                           -requires.
                                   /path/to/find-requires  Use the specified
                                                           external program.
    --target <TARGET>          Sub-directory name for all generated
                               artifacts. May be specified with
                               CARGO_BUILD_TARGET environment variable
    --target-dir <TARGET_DIR>  Directory for all generated artifacts. May be
                               specified with CARGO_BUILD_TARGET_DIR or
                               CARGO_TARGET_DIR environment variables
    --profile <PROFILE>        Build profile for packaging [default:
                               release]
    --payload-compress <PAYLOAD_COMPRESS> Compression type of package
                               payload [default: zstd] [possible values:
                               none, gzip, zstd, xz]
    --source-date <SOURCE_DATE> Timestamp in seconds since the UNIX Epoch
                               for clamping modification time of included
                               files and package build time. This value can
                               also be provided using the SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
                               enviroment variable.
    --metadata-overwrite <METADATA_OVERWRITE> Overwrite metadata with TOML
                               file. If "#dotted.key" suffixed, load
                               "dotted.key" table instead of the root table
-s, --set-metadata <SET_METADATA> Overwrite metadata with TOML text
    --variant <VARIANT>        Shortcut to
                               --metadata-overwrite=path/to/Cargo.toml#packa
                               ge.metadata.generate-rpm.variants.VARIANT
-h, --help                     Print help (see a summary with '-h')
-V, --version                  Print version
